(40112, 187, 261, '<td valign="top">As the page was loading, i expected to see a macro view of half a reed frog... thank god i didn''t! ;-).. I think your jpeg compression is too high.. so its hard to tell if your shot was off focus or it is the compression... pity.. at full focus it would have been a great shot</td>', 'As the page was loading, i expected to see a macro view of half a reed frog... thank god i didn''t! ;-).. I think your jpeg compression is too high.. so its hard to tell if your shot was off focus or it is the compression... pity.. at full focus it would have been a great shot', '2002-03-01 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(40113, 187, 347, '<td valign="top">Dammit, frogs are cool too! Looks like there are some nasty JPEG artifacts here, though, and that loses a point.</td>', 'Dammit, frogs are cool too! Looks like there are some nasty JPEG artifacts here, though, and that loses a point.', '2002-03-01 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
