(40122, 189, 308, '<td valign="top">This competition was really fun and I am glad that I participated.  I''m kind of bummed that I got called out for not taking a macro shot when I did follow the rules and used the macro function on my camera.  But I''m happy with the results, regardless.  Thanks for all of the comments, both good and bad, I appreciate them.</td>', 'This competition was really fun and I am glad that I participated.  I''m kind of bummed that I got called out for not taking a macro shot when I did follow the rules and used the macro function on my camera.  But I''m happy with the results, regardless.  Thanks for all of the comments, both good and bad, I appreciate them.', '2002-03-11 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
