(39828, 154, 347, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I dunno. This just doesn''t do anything for me. Technically, it''s fine; the subject matter is fine; but the title is a hint to what bothers me. "unable to move" implies restraint, forced immobility; whereas I just see this as "stationary" rather than "immobile". Perhaps if it looked like the central post were trying to get away or move, then it''d be more deserving of the title. I don''t mind the shot, it just doesn''t do anything for me. Sorry.</td>', 'Hmm... I dunno. This just doesn''t do anything for me. Technically, it''s fine; the subject matter is fine; but the title is a hint to what bothers me. "unable to move" implies restraint, forced immobility; whereas I just see this as "stationary" rather than "immobile". Perhaps if it looked like the central post were trying to get away or move, then it''d be more deserving of the title. I don''t mind the shot, it just doesn''t do anything for me. Sorry.', '2002-03-05 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(39829, 154, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems a little over-exposed.  If you''re taking an image of a dark setting, you should keep the image dark.  No sense lighting up something that isn''t lit.</td>', 'Seems a little over-exposed.  If you''re taking an image of a dark setting, you should keep the image dark.  No sense lighting up something that isn''t lit.', '2002-03-10 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
